✅ Use favorites & search

Step 1: Play a Song
Just click any song card → music starts playing instantly

https://via.placeholder.com/400x200/1a1a1a/ffffff?text=Click+Any+Song+Card

Player controls (appears at bottom):

⏸️ Pause | ⏮️ Previous | ⏭️ Next

Click progress bar → jump to any part

Drag volume slider → adjust sound

Step 2: Add Your Own Song
2.1 Get an audio link (Catbox - free)
bash
1. Go to https://catbox.moe
2. Click "Browse" → select your MP3 file
3. Click "Upload"
4. Copy the link (looks like: https://files.catbox.moe/xxxxx.mp3)
2.2 Get a cover image
bash
1. Google Image search your song
2. Right-click any image → "Copy image address"
2.3 Add to SongBox
bash
1. Click green "+ Add Song" button (bottom-right)
2. Fill in:
   - Title: "My Song"
   - Artist: "My Name"
   - Catbox link: [paste from step 2.1]
   - Image URL: [paste from step 2.2]
3. Click "Add Song"
✅ Done! Your song appears at the top of the list

Step 3: Create a Playlist
bash
1. Look at left sidebar → click "+ New Playlist"
2. Type a name: "Chill Vibes" (or anything)
3. Press Enter
Add songs to your playlist
bash
1. Hover over any song
2. Click the "+" button that appears
3. Select your playlist name
4. ✅ Song added!
View your playlist
bash
Click the playlist name in sidebar → see all songs inside
Remove from playlist
bash
While viewing playlist → click red trash icon on any song
Rename or delete playlist
bash
Open the playlist → use "Rename" or "Delete" buttons at top
Step 4: Use Favorites
bash
Click the ❤️ heart on any song → turns red
View favorites: Click "Favorites" in sidebar

Remove favorites: Click red heart again

Step 5: Search Songs
bash
Type in search bar → results filter instantly
Example: Type "ordinary" → shows only that song

Clear search: Click "✕" button in search bar

Step 6: Dark/Light Mode
bash
Click 🌙 button (top-right) → switches to light mode
Click ☀️ button → switches back to dark
