Common Problems & Fixes
❌ Song won't play?
Fix: Make sure your Catbox link ends with .mp3

❌ Image not showing?
Fix: Right-click image → "Copy image address" (not page link)

❌ Can't find my playlist?
Fix: Look in left sidebar under "Playlists" section

❌ Songs disappeared after refresh?

Happy listening! 🎵
Fix: They shouldn't! Check if you cleared browser data

